6. Run in terminal to check locally (Tests run: 2, Failures: 0):
mvn clean test
7. Run in terminal (replace YOUR_USERNAME):
git init
git add .
git commit -m "Java app with GitLab CI build and test stages"
git branch -M main
git remote add origin https://gitlab.com/YOUR_USERNAME/GitLabJavaMaven.git
git push -u origin main
8. On first push a sign-in window opens - log in to GitLab. If it asks for a password, use an access
token instead: GitLab > Avatar > Preferences > Access tokens > tick write_repository > create
> paste the token as the password.
9. GitLab > Build > Pipelines > open the pipeline - build and test stages run by themselves (first
run takes 1-3 min; stuck on "pending" = account not verified).
